{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"type-alias-alpinetabletfeatures-tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Alias: AlpineTable<TFeatures, TData>"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type AlpineTable<TFeatures, TData> = Table<TFeatures, TData> & object;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/alpine-table/src/createTable.ts#L14","children":[{"type":"text","value":"createTable.ts:14"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-declaration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Declaration"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"flexrender","children":[{"type":"text","value":"flexRender"}]},{"type":"code","value":"flexRender: typeof flexRender;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A lower-level helper to render the content of a cell, header, or footer from a render function and its context."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"flexrender-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FlexRender"}]},{"type":"code","value":"FlexRender: typeof FlexRender;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A convenience helper to render a cell, header, or footer object. Call from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"x-html"},{"type":"text","value":", e.g. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"FlexRender({ header })"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tfeatures","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFeatures"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TableFeatures"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RowData"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-alias-alpinetabletfeatures-tdata","text":"Type Alias: AlpineTable<TFeatures, TData>","level":1},{"id":"type-declaration","text":"Type Declaration","level":2},{"id":"flexrender","text":"flexRender","level":3},{"id":"flexrender-2","text":"FlexRender","level":3},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Type Alias: AlpineTable\\<TFeatures, TData\\>\n\n```ts\ntype AlpineTable<TFeatures, TData> = Table<TFeatures, TData> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [createTable.ts:14](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/alpine-table/src/createTable.ts#L14)\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### flexRender\n\n```ts\nflexRender: typeof flexRender;\n```\n\nA lower-level helper to render the content of a cell, header, or footer from a render function and its context.\n\n### FlexRender\n\n```ts\nFlexRender: typeof FlexRender;\n```\n\nA convenience helper to render a cell, header, or footer object. Call from `x-html`, e.g. `FlexRender({ header })`.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: AlpineTable\ntitle: AlpineTable\n---\n\n# Type Alias: AlpineTable\\<TFeatures, TData\\>\n\n```ts\ntype AlpineTable<TFeatures, TData> = Table<TFeatures, TData> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [createTable.ts:14](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/alpine-table/src/createTable.ts#L14)\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### flexRender\n\n```ts\nflexRender: typeof flexRender;\n```\n\nA lower-level helper to render the content of a cell, header, or footer from a render function and its context.\n\n### FlexRender\n\n```ts\nFlexRender: typeof FlexRender;\n```\n\nA convenience helper to render a cell, header, or footer object. Call from `x-html`, e.g. `FlexRender({ header })`.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n"}
